WEBVTT

01:02:58.640 --> 01:03:02.288
And I've been taught a distinction
between happiness and joy.

01:03:02.312 --> 01:03:04.002
And I shoot for joy.

01:03:04.026 --> 01:03:07.148
Happiness is when you win a victory.

01:03:07.172 --> 01:03:09.146
It's about the expansion of self:

01:03:09.170 --> 01:03:12.236
you get a promotion;
your team wins the Super Bowl.

01:03:12.260 --> 01:03:16.773
Joy is about the transcendence of self,
when you forget about yourself.

01:03:16.797 --> 01:03:19.776
It's when you're dancing with others
and you lose yourself.

01:03:19.800 --> 01:03:23.959
It's a mother and daughter
in communion with each other.

01:03:23.983 --> 01:03:27.763
It's when you're with your crowd
and you forget all about yourself.

01:03:27.787 --> 01:03:31.208
And to me, the highest thing
to shoot for in life is moral joy.